NSSM - the Non-Sucking Service Manager
Version 2.24-101-g897c7ad (pre-release build of 2017-04-26)

Used by Vigil only to register its supervisor as a Windows service in system
mode (SPECIFICATION.md 18.2). 2.24, the last release, is not used: it fails
to start services on Windows 10 Creators Update and later. NSSM is no longer
maintained upstream.

